direction: right


implement: |md
  # 1. Implement

  **Produces (optional)**

  - `givn outline report`
  - **Outline** — signatures and calls
  - Supporting metrics

  **Checks**

  - Nothing; the report never blocks
| {
  style.fill: "#eef2ff"
  style.stroke: "#4f46e5"
  style.border-radius: 10
  style.font-size: 20
}

review: |md
  # 2. Review

  **Produces**

  - `OUTLINE: PASS` or `FAIL` per touched unit
  - `AUTHOR`, `REVIEWER`, `OUTLINE: PASS`

  **Checks**

  - Every printed outline has a verdict
  - `PASS` explains responsibility and call order
  - `FAIL` blocks; no justification path
  - The reviewer differs from the author
| {
  style.fill: "#fff7ed"
  style.stroke: "#ea580c"
  style.border-radius: 10
  style.font-size: 20
}

archive: |md
  # 3. Archive

  **Produces**

  - Nothing new

  **Checks**

  - The review record is complete
  - An outlined unit without a verdict blocks archive
| {
  style.fill: "#f0fdf4"
  style.stroke: "#16a34a"
  style.border-radius: 10
  style.font-size: 20
}

implement -> review: "next phase"
review -> archive: "next phase"
